    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it's hard to say it's just moths when the jar actually feels like it's been shifted an inch or two. and i've checked for bugs and everything looks clean. it's just this super specific feeling of being watched or like there's these tiny, shadow-like presences in the kitchen that only show up when i'm working with the starter. it's almost like there are these little, invisible little beings that are attracted to the fermentation or something. do you think there's any folklore or even just weird coincidences where people talk about little household spirits or things like that being triggered by certain foods or smells?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
